   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "To whom we must give account",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No creature can be hidden",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We hold fast to our confession",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Our high priest passed through the heavens",
